{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24868","headline":"广州石门寺重送李尚赴朝时兼宗正卿 · 杨衡","name":"广州石门寺重送李尚赴朝时兼宗正卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"象阙趋云陛，龙宫憩石门。\n清铙犹啓路，黄发重攀辕。\n藻变朝天服，珠怀委地言。\n那令蓬蒿客，兹席未离尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}